      "side": 1,
      "message": "All other FBOs always start their draws with a glClear, and FBO 0 will sometimes.\n\nThere are a two cases in which we can disable blending:\n\n1) First draw on FBO without GL clear. This only applies to FBO 0 when app window is opaque, which is most apps.\n\n2) First draw on FBO with GL clear, if disabling is equivalent to drawing. Really just need to cover SRC_OVER, since that\u0027s most content.\n\nI\u0027ve left comments suggesting how to handle just the first case, but we could also add more complexity to handle the 2nd case too. Do you know how frequently, or how much that case would help?",
      "revId": "9698298dfc29626cc42ca6a043156dec0607d3e0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
